# DADZCO Brand OS — Edge Function Secrets (server-only)
#
# Purpose:
#   Template listing the secrets required by Supabase Edge Functions.
#   This file is safe to commit (no real values). Copy to
#   `supabase/functions/.env` for local `supabase functions serve`; that
#   copy is git-ignored.
#
# Production:
#   Set these in Supabase Dashboard → Project Settings → Edge Functions →
#   Secrets, or
#   `supabase secrets set KEY=value --project-ref strthzrvmoeyvuindugk`.
#
# Rules:
#   - Never prefix provider secrets with VITE_ (that would bundle them
#     into the client at build time).
#   - Never paste real keys into this file.
#   - Never commit a copy of this file named `.env`.

# ─── ai-route function ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Used by:   supabase/functions/ai-route/index.ts
#
# structured_task → OpenAI GPT-4.1
OPENAI_API_KEY=

# brand_review    → Anthropic Claude Sonnet 4
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# ─── check-gates function ───────────────────────────────────────────
# Used by:   supabase/functions/check-gates/index.ts
#
# Required by scheduled/internal callers through the x-internal-secret
# request header. Generate a strong random value for real environments.
CHECK_GATES_INTERNAL_SECRET=your-internal-secret-here

# ─── Auto-injected by Supabase (do NOT set manually in hosted env) ──
# SUPABASE_URL
# SUPABASE_ANON_KEY
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY   (used by ai-route's requireAdmin check)
